@baseUrl = https://localhost:7081
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ACCESS_TOKEN
### Vida sin Azure
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
### Dependencias; 503 mientras no esté habilitada identidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
### Registro (requiere Azure y migración)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ana","lastName":"Pérez","email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}
### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@example.com","password":"Frase de prueba 2026!"}
### Perfil propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Reemplazar perfil editable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ana María","lastName":"Pérez"}
